# AI Roadmap - Phase 2: Mathematics for AI (Beginner to Advanced)

This guide teaches every Phase 2 topic from your master plan with AI-focused intuition, formulas, examples, and interview-style questions.

## How to Use This Document

- Study in order: Linear Algebra -> Probability & Statistics -> Calculus.
- For each topic, first read Intuition, then Core Theory, then AI Use Cases.
- Solve mini checks before moving ahead.
- Revisit advanced notes while doing ML and DL projects.

