## Phase 2 Learning Outcomes

By the end of this phase, you should be able to:

1. Represent AI data mathematically (vectors, matrices, tensors).
2. Explain uncertainty and model confidence using probability/statistics.
3. Understand optimization in ML/DL using gradients and gradient descent.
4. Read research papers with mathematical comfort.

